title: 'frame-system: refund authorize weight when AuthorizeCall skips the callback'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    `AuthorizeCall` books `weight_of_authorize` for every transaction, but when the origin is
    already authorized (for example a signed transaction) it does not run the call's
    `#[pallet::authorize]` callback. It now reports that weight as unspent, so it is refunded after
    dispatch instead of staying booked for work that never ran.
crates:
- name: frame-system
  bump: patch
